return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-13T00:42:30+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-13T00:42:30+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A fast, privacy-respecting live chat for your website. Answers visitors with AI when you are busy, hands them to you when they need a person, and emails you anything you miss. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until somebody opens it.'=>'Wadahadal toos ah oo degdeg ah oo ilaaliya asturnaanta oo loogu talagalay mareegahaaga. Wuxuu ku jawaabaa booqdayaasha AI marka aad mashquulsan tahay, wuxuu kuugu dhiibaa marka ay u baahan yihiin qof, wuxuuna kuu soo diraa emayl wax kasta oo kaaga baxa bogga. Wax ka yar 10 KB oo bogga ah mana jiraan wax codsiyo ah haba yaraatee ilaa qof ka furo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Settings'=>'Dejinta','That does not look like a Zinn® Chat key. Copy it from the Live chat page of your Zinn Digital® dashboard — it starts with zc_.'=>'Taasi uma ekaato fure Zinn® Chat. Ka soo guuri bogga Live chat ee sabuuraddaada kontoroolka ee Zinn Digital® — wuxuu ka billowdaa zc_.','Add your chat key before switching the chat on — without it there is nothing for the widget to connect to.'=>'Ku dar furahaaga sheekada ka hor inta aanad shidin sheekada — adiga oo aan lahayn ma jiro wax ay agabku ku xirmaan.','Live chat for this site. Visitors get an answer straight away, you get anything you miss by email, and the whole thing is under 10 KB on the page.'=>'Wadahadal toos ah oo loogu talagalay boggan. Booqadayaashu waxay helayaan jawaab isla markiiba, waxaad email ku heleysaa wax kasta oo ku dhaafa, wax walbana waa ka yar yihiin 10 KB bogga dushiisa.','The chat is live on this site.'=>'Wadahadalku wuxuu ka toosan yahay boggan.','The chat is switched off. Nothing is loaded on your site.'=>'Wadahadalku waa dansan yahay. Waxba lagama soo raray boggaaga.','Chat key'=>'Furaha sheekada','Copy this from the Live chat page of your %s.'=>'Ka koobiy tan bogga sheekaysiga tooska ah ee %sadaada.','Zinn Digital® dashboard'=>'Golaha maamulka ee Zinn Digital®','Show the chat'=>'Muuji sheekada','Show the chat window to visitors of this site'=>'U muuji daaqadda wadahadalka booqashada boggan','Until you tick this, the plugin adds nothing at all to your pages — no script, no cookie, no requests.'=>'Ilaa aad tan saxeyso, furaha (plugin) waxba kuma daro baxyadaada — ma jiro qoraal barnaamijyeed (script), ma jiro buskud (cookie), ma jiraan codsiyo.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri %s hagaha isticmaalaha','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting for WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, gurmadyada maalinlaha ah, haajiradda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga xakamaynta ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibsii oo iibi mareegaha la aas-aasay, agabyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyeyaasha, adoo lacagta si ammaan ah u haya ilaa labada dhinac ay ka farxayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan u shaqaysta xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa caalamiga ah ee xorta ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyeyaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u ogolow inay ku tartamaan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Eeg qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey waa ay ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka daacadnimadeeda mana aan lagu rakibin.']];